sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Ingestion API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    C->>S: Upload document, hash = h
    S->>D: Begin insert
    Note over C,S: Client times out, server keeps working
    C->>S: Retry the same document
    D-->>S: First transaction commits
    S->>D: Retry inserts the same h
    D-->>S: Unique constraint rejects duplicate
    S->>D: Roll back and look up h
    D-->>S: Existing artifact
    S-->>C: status = duplicate
